.SH NAME
scripttool\-fadein \- converting from FadeIn files
.SH SYNOPSIS
scripttool VERB FILENAME.fadein [OUTPUT_FILENAME]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A FadeIn file is a zipped XML document, so it cannot be read from
standard input.
The input filename is required for these verbs.
.TP
fadein2fdx
to Final Draft XML
.TP
fadein2fountain
to Fountain
.TP
fadein2json
to JSON
.TP
fadein2yaml
to YAML
.TP
fadein2osf
